WEBVTT

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.926
We all know it by now:

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:04.166
glaciers melting, forest fires,

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:06.276
more extreme weather events.

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.576
And this is just the beginning.

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:14.334
We saw the prospect of many new jobs
created by the transition;

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:18.976
European citizens,
who, in their overwhelming majority,

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:24.206
consider that climate change
is a very serious problem;

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:27.526
our youth demanding
action for their future,

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:28.903
and rightly so.

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:32.646
Building on this, in September 2020,